<title>HONG KONG: ITC Holdings buys Nam Pei stake.</title>
<headline>ITC Holdings buys Nam Pei stake.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tung Fong Hung (Holdings) Ltd said on Monday it had agreed to sell 67.86 million shares and 8.03 million warrants in Nam Pei Hong (Holdings) Ltd for HK$71.9 million to International Tak Cheung Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>The shares, sold for HK$1.00 each, represent about 29 percent of Nam Pei Hong's issued share capital and the warrants, sold for HK$0.50 each and carrying rights to subscribe for one Nam Pei Hong share at HK$0.50, represent about 31 percent of outstanding Nam Pei Hong warrants.</p>
</text>
